1
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:15,220
The cold wind softly blows again

2
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:19,420
Carrying your scent away with it

3
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:24,910
Like the final words we never said

4
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:31,120
You pass through my heart, quietly, gently

5
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:36,620
These foolish hands tried to hold on

6
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,900
But now they tremble, letting go

7
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:46,950
Even when I knew the end had come

8
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:51,400
I still lived inside our yesterday

9
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:59,590
Goodbye, my love, my everything

10
00:00:59,590 --> 00:01:03,560
I won’t reach out anymore

11
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:06,740
It’s time to let you go, my dear

12
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:14,040
And hide you deep inside my soul

13
00:01:16,110 --> 00:01:20,110
A gentle cry, a silent tear

14
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:23,020
Whispered under Tokyo’s night

15
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:28,360
Goodbye, my love, my everything

16
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:33,400
The last say goodbye

17
00:01:57,670 --> 00:02:01,820
Your shadow fades along the street

18
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,650
I smile, pretending I’m alright

19
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:11,320
In old photographs, you’re still there

20
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:16,660
Smiling brighter than the morning light

21
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:23,540
All the moments we once shared

22
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:28,880
Now drift like soft film memories

23
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:33,710
They shimmer, blur, and disappear

24
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:39,090
Like snow that melts in spring

25
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:47,150
Goodbye, my love, my everything

26
00:02:47,150 --> 00:02:51,280
I won’t reach out anymore

27
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:54,110
It’s time to let you go, my dear

28
00:02:54,110 --> 00:03:01,820
And hide you deep inside my soul

29
00:03:03,710 --> 00:03:07,830
A gentle cry, a silent tear

30
00:03:07,830 --> 00:03:10,620
Whispered under Tokyo’s night

31
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:15,920
Goodbye, my love, my everything

32
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:20,420
The last say goodbye

33
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:26,960
To forget you — maybe impossible

34
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:31,140
But I’ve learned to breathe again

35
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:36,300
Our story ends here quietly

36
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:40,410
Like a record’s final spin

37
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:47,860
Goodbye, my love, my everything

38
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:51,870
The city hums our melody

39
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:54,790
Farewell, my love... please be happy

40
00:03:54,790 --> 00:04:02,000
Under the same fading sky

